    "The kill switch blocks traffic while the proxy is down. Strict mode routes all system traffic through the tunnel and can affect AirDrop and local network features. Changes apply on the next connection." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kill Switch 會在代理無法使用時阻擋流量。嚴格模式會讓所有系統流量都經過通道，可能影響 AirDrop 與區域網路功能。變更會在下次連線時生效。"
